Rating</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Highest_Spot_on_HOF\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Highest Spot on HOF</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#First_time_on_HOF\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">First time on HOF</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Reclaimed_HOF\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reclaimed HOF</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Levels\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Levels</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Streaks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Streaks</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Problems_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problems</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Days\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.7.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Days</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Days_practiced\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Days practiced</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Topics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Topics</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#Passed\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.9.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Passed</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#Mastered\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.9.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Mastered</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-21\"><a href=\"#Completion\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Completion</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-22\"><a href=\"#Quests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.10.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-23\"><a href=\"#Achievements\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.10.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Achievements</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-24\"><a href=\"#XP_bonus\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">XP bonus</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-25\"><a href=\"#MC_trainer_stats\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">MC trainer stats</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-26\"><a href=\"#Level\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Level</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-27\"><a href=\"#Details_(XP)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Details (XP)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-28\"><a href=\"#Ratings\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ratings</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-29\"><a href=\"#XP\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">XP</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-30\"><a href=\"#Best_day\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Best day</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-31\"><a href=\"#Best_week\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Best week</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-32\"><a href=\"#Streaks_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Streaks</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-33\"><a href=\"#All_-_time_problems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">All - time problems</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-34\"><a href=\"#All_-_time_days\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">All - time days</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-35\"><a href=\"#Problems_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problems</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-36\"><a href=\"#AMC_--_AIME_--_USA(J)MO_--_MOP_--_IMO\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AMC -- AIME -- USA(J)MO -- MOP -- IMO</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-37\"><a href=\"#AMC_8\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AMC 8</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-38\"><a href=\"#AMC_10\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AMC 10</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-39\"><a href=\"#AIME\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AIME</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-40\"><a href=\"#Other_stuff\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other stuff</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-41\"><a href=\"#Contributions_to_the_AoPS_wiki\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Contributions to the AoPS wiki</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-42\"><a href=\"#AMC_10_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AMC 10</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-43\"><a href=\"#AMC_12\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AMC 12</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-44\"><a href=\"#AIME_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AIME</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"This_page_is_about_me...\">This page is about me...</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: This page is about me...\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Details\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Posts\">Posts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Posts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Official_Posts\">Official Posts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Official Posts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>2822\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"User_.23\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"User_#\">User #</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: User #\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>947001\n</p><p>So my Alcumus profile: \n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/alcumus/profile/947001\">profile #947001</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other\">Other</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Other\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>I am (not) orz\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alcumus_Stats\">Alcumus Stats</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Alcumus Stats\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems\">Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>9375 (7879 correct, 1478 incorrect, 18 give ups)\n</p><p>This might not be up to date, but approximate or accurate numbers\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Highest_Overall_Rating\">Highest Overall Rating</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Highest Overall Rating\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>99.98 (39th on HOF)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Highest_Spot_on_HOF\">Highest Spot on HOF</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Highest Spot on HOF\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>38th on HOF (achieved Aug 9, 2026, at 14:00 PST)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"First_time_on_HOF\">First time on HOF</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: First time on HOF\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>January 30, 2026, at 20:32 PST\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reclaimed_HOF\">Reclaimed HOF</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Reclaimed HOF\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Aug 7, 2026, at 13:58 PST\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Levels\">Levels</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Levels\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Overall                | 25\n</p><p>Prealgebra             | 25\n</p><p>Algebra                | 25\n</p><p>Number Theory          | 25\n</p><p>Counting &amp; Probability | 25\n</p><p>Geometry               | 25\n</p><p>Intermediate Algebra   | 25\n</p><p>Precalculus            | 22\n</p><p>Stamina                | 25\n</p><p>Accuracy               | 25\n</p><p>Power                  | 25\n</p><p>Resilience             | 25\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Streaks\">Streaks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Streaks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems_2\">Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>758\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Days\">Days</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section: Days\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>49\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Days_practiced\">Days practiced</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17\" title=\"Edit section: Days practiced\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>506 days\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Topics\">Topics</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=18\" title=\"Edit section: Topics\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Passed\">Passed</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=19\" title=\"Edit section: Passed\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>295/295! \n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mastered\">Mastered</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20\" title=\"Edit section: Mastered\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>295/295!\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Completion\">Completion</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=21\" title=\"Edit section: Completion\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests\">Quests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=22\" title=\"Edit section: Quests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>67 quests (hahahaha so funny)\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Achievements\">Achievements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=23\" title=\"Edit section: Achievements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>81 achievements\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"XP_bonus\">XP bonus</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=24\" title=\"Edit section: XP bonus\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>0/20 \n</p><p>I don't practice Alcumus much anymore\nEDIT: now I do\nEDIT: now I don't \nEDIT: now I do\nEDIT: now I don't\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"MC_trainer_stats\">MC trainer stats</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=25\" title=\"Edit section: MC trainer stats\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Yeah, I haven't done this since early 2025.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Level\">Level</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=26\" title=\"Edit section: Level\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Level 24\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h4><span id=\"Details_.28XP.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details_(XP)\">Details (XP)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=27\" title=\"Edit section: Details (XP)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>1359 XP\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ratings\">Ratings</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=28\" title=\"Edit section: Ratings\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>School                 | 46\n</p><p>Chapter                | 46\n</p><p>State                  | 36\n</p><p>Nationals              | 17\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"XP\">XP</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=29\" title=\"Edit section: XP\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Best_day\">Best day</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=30\" title=\"Edit section: Best day\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>2845 XP (7/20/2023)\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Best_week\">Best week</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=31\" title=\"Edit section: Best week\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>6725 XP (7/16/2023 - 7/23/2023)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Streaks_2\">Streaks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=32\" title=\"Edit section: Streaks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"All_-_time_problems\">All - time problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=33\" title=\"Edit section: All - time problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>56 \n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"All_-_time_days\">All - time days</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=34\" title=\"Edit section: All - time days\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>6\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems_3\">Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=35\" title=\"Edit section: Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>986 out of 1343 correct\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"AMC_--_AIME_--_USA.28J.29MO_--_MOP_--_IMO\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AMC_--_AIME_--_USA(J)MO_--_MOP_--_IMO\">AMC -- AIME -- USA(J)MO -- MOP -- IMO</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=36\" title=\"Edit section: AMC -- AIME -- USA(J)MO -- MOP -- IMO\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AMC_8\">AMC 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=37\" title=\"Edit section: AMC 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>I took the 2023 AMC 8 in 2nd grade and got a 19 (HR, 2 off DHR)\n</p><p>I took the 2024 AMC 8 in 3rd grade and got a 22 (1 above DHR!! yay)\n</p><p>I took the 2025 AMC 8 in 4th grade and got a 23 (bruhhhh)\n</p><p>I took the 2026 AMC 8 in 5th grade and got a 23 (misbubble + counting 8 items as 7 cost me that)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AMC_10\">AMC 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=38\" title=\"Edit section: AMC 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>I took the 2023 AMC 10A in 3rd grade and got a 93 (10 points off AIME)\n</p><p>I took the 2023 AMC 10B in 3rd grade and got a 90 (15 points off AIME)\n</p><p>I took the 2024 AMC 12A in 4th grade and got a 91.5 (15 points over AIME)\n</p><p>I took the 2024 AMC 10B in 4th grade and got a 94.5 (10.5 points off AIME)\n</p><p>I took the 2025 AMC 12A in 5th grade and got a 90 (..much worse than last year)\n</p><p>I took the 2025 AMC 10B in 5th grade and got a 114 (9 points over HR, 15 points over AIME)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AIME\">AIME</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=39\" title=\"Edit section: AIME\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>I took the 2025 AIME I in 4th grade and I got a 5 \n</p><p>I took the 2026 AIME I in 5th grade and I got a 9 (with a bloody nose during the test)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_stuff\">Other stuff</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=40\" title=\"Edit section: Other stuff\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>I..\n</p><p>knew 450 digits of pi (keyword: knew. I only remember 350 as of October 2026)\n</p><p>have a TI-84 Plus CE graphing calculator and a TI N-spire CX II graphing calculator (and a relatively trash TI-30X calculator)\n</p><p>am not a robot (I'm looking at you, CAPTCHA)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Contributions_to_the_AoPS_wiki\">Contributions to the AoPS wiki</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=41\" title=\"Edit section: Contributions to the AoPS wiki\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>warning: quite out of date. i forgot them all\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AMC_10_2\">AMC 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=42\" title=\"Edit section: AMC 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>1. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/2020_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14#Solution_10_.28Algebra_Bash.29\">2020 AMC10A Problem 14 (Solution 10)</a>\n</p><p>2. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/2023_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15#Solution_4\">2023 AMC10A Problem 15 (Solution 4)</a>\n</p><p>3. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/2023_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8#Solution_4_.28Bashy.29\">2023 AMC10B Problem 8 (Solution 4)</a>\n</p><p>4. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/2023_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2#Solution_3_.28quick.29\">2023 AIME I Problem 2 (Solution 3)</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AMC_12\">AMC 12</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=43\" title=\"Edit section: AMC 12\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>N/A\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AIME_2\">AIME</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yrock&amp;action=edit&amp;section=44\" title=\"Edit section: AIME\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>5. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10#Solution_4_.28graphing.29\">2019 AMC10B Problem 10 (Solution 4)</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018114414\nCache